@startuml sequence-mileage-adapter
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica Neue"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam UsecaseBackgroundColor #FFFFCE
skinparam UsecaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #000000
skinparam ActorFontColor #000000
skinparam RectangleBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #000000
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFFFCE
skinparam StateBorderColor #000000
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFCE
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam LifelineBorderColor #000000
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #777777

title <color:#C00000>Sequence Diagram - Skypass Mileage Deduction via Adapter (Iteration 4, DP#7)</color>
participant "Client" as CL
participant "skypass : SkypassInterface\n(= SkypassAdapter)" as ADP
participant "RemoteSkypassApi" as API
CL -> ADP : <color:#C00000>deductMileage(skypassNo, amount)</color>
ADP -> API : <color:#C00000>postDeduct(skypassNo, amount)</color>
API --> ADP : <color:#C00000>Map { success }</color>
ADP -> ADP : <color:#C00000>translate Map -> boolean</color>
ADP --> CL : <color:#C00000>boolean</color>
note over CL, API : FxApp wires SkypassAdapter(adaptee) into AppContext;\nthe client depends only on SkypassInterface (Adapter, DP#7).
@enduml
